{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/20/photo_5-thumb.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/20/photo_6-thumb.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはようございます\nん～～～～～！ななせまる！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ久々の更新になってしまってすいません(T ^ T)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず寒いですね、冬がきますね・・・"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"23日の水曜日、楽しみっ\n大阪で仕事だなんてー！ ！\n握手会もあるので是非きてください。\n早くみなさんと会いたいなぁ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃ！ちょいと質問返しします"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●ドラマーさん\n好きなとこというか気になってるのは\n「あほや」です\n昔食べたけど味を忘れて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●しょーじちゃんさん\n外国！外国めっちゃ好きです！\nとか言うてグアム、韓国、上海しか\n行ったことないです羨ましいです。\n春にフランス留学が決まってたけど\n乃木坂46に受かったのでキャンセルしました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●エイシンフラッシュさん\n完璧な篠田麻里子さんです！\n個人的に好きだからもあります\n暇なときは自分と敵が戦ってる妄想とかを\nよくしてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●きまぐれDsさん\nさて出演できるのでしょうか…\n応援ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●大吾さん\n実はままが応募したんです\nそれまでakbのオーディションとかも\n受けたことなくて\n乃木坂ってなんなん？思って調べたら…\nすごい！ライバル！\n「ライバル」に惹かれたわけです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●のんたんさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特にないです；；；；お茶くらいです；；；"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●淡路人さん\n小っちゃい時に行きました\n海で花火しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●ともきんさん\n大丈夫です。\n白ご飯さえあれば私は大丈夫です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にゃにゃせまる全然オッケーですありがとうございます＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●優(ゆう)さん\n玉ねぎは抜いてもらってますよん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●しょーごさん\n全然ありです、ギャップは大好きですよ\nありがとうございます(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●れな@横浜さん\n勇者たちは何回聴いても良いです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●全力男さん\n椿油は、寝る前とかに髪につけます\nほんなら次の日\nパサパサやった髪に、しっとりと潤いが！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●みぐぅさん\n使うと手がベタベタするんで(笑)\nたまに使ってますよん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●だーさわさん\nわんわん物語が好きでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●りょーちんさん\n鳥が好きなことは負けないです\n誇りを持っています\nあとは…めっちゃ方向音痴じゃないことです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●りんさん\n運動は、得意とは言えないです\n跳び箱だけは好きですえへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●turkeyさん\nいいえ、残念ながら！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●貴之さん\nヒレカツ大好きです\n料理できません(T ^ T)炒めることしか…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●ゆーくんさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日おめでとうございました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●シャレスさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ボーリングも怖いです、ボーリングしたことないんです＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●自称ブルースウィリスさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんな世代の方に支持されるようなアイドルグループになりたいです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●大吾さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"移動中はですねぇとにかく寝てます！「もう寝やんでいいわ」ってなるまで寝てます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●けんとんぬさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪から通ってますよー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんなさい、とりあえずここまでにします\nありがとうございました\nまた次回を見てください！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだの私服シンプルでした\n二枚目の写真は、修学旅行で韓国に行ったとき！\nトイレットペーパーの大きさに\nびっくりしたなぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん～～～～～！\nにゃにゃせ更新率あげますよ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校だぁぁぁぁぁぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/22/doiya06.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バイッッッ"}],"source":"archive"}